<BaseLayout title="About Buy Better Finds | Independent Product Research & Reviews" description="Meet Buy Better Finds, an independent product research and evaluation website. Learn about our Buy Better Score, product comparisons, buying guides, and editorial approach.">
  <article class="article">
    <div class="eyebrow">About Buy Better Finds</div>
    <h1>Independent Product Research for More Confident Shopping</h1>
    <p class="lead">Buy Better Finds is an independent product research, evaluation, and shopping recommendation website. We help shoppers understand product features, compare meaningful differences, and consider tradeoffs before making a purchase. Our Buy Better Score gives our editorial evaluations a consistent, recognizable framework.</p>
    <p>Our goal is to make product research clearer—not to overwhelm shoppers with endless choices or repeat marketing claims. We focus on practical information that can help people decide which products may fit their needs and which may not.</p>

    <h2>Our editorial approach</h2>
    <p>We research products, review available specifications and features, consider intended use, compare relevant alternatives, and explain strengths and limitations. We aim to add original analysis and useful context rather than simply reproduce retailer or manufacturer descriptions.</p>
    <p>Most of our product evaluations are research-based. We do not imply that a product was personally handled or tested unless the specific page clearly identifies genuine hands-on testing.</p>
    <p><a href="/why-we-recommend/">Read the Buy Better Finds Standards and evaluation methodology →</a></p>

    <h2>The Buy Better Score</h2>
    <p>The Buy Better Score is our editorial assessment on a 10-point scale. It considers use-case fit, useful features, practicality, value, and documented tradeoffs. It is our own evaluation—not an Amazon customer rating, retailer score, laboratory result, or paid placement.</p>

    <h2>Independence and affiliate relationships</h2>
    <p>Buy Better Finds may participate in affiliate programs. If you purchase through a qualifying affiliate link, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate compensation does not guarantee a recommendation or positive coverage and does not determine the Buy Better Score.</p>
    <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>

    <h2>Prices and product information</h2>
    <p>Prices, availability, specifications, promotions, shipping, and return policies can change. Always confirm current information with the retailer or manufacturer before purchasing.</p>

    <h2>Product imagery</h2>
    <p>Product imagery is sourced from manufacturer media resources, authorized press materials, original photography, or other sources where appropriate usage rights are established. We do not represent manufacturer or retailer imagery as original photography.</p>

    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <p>Clearer information, useful evaluations, transparent affiliate relationships, and a better shopping experience.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>